  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Exchange Swedish/Tanzanian Ministries of Finance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbyte Sveriges och Tanzanias finansministerier</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A delegation from the Swedish Ministry of Finance visited Dare es Salaam in November 2013. The visit will be followed up with a second visit in 2014. The purpose is to exchange experiences between the budget sections of the two ministries. The partners will assess whether lessons from Swedish budget reforms would be useful for Tanzania and explore opportunities for enhanced cooperation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

En delegation fr&#xe5;n det svenska finansdepartementet bes&#xf6;kte under november 2013 Dar es Salaam. Bes&#xf6;ket kommer att f&#xf6;ljas upp med ett andra bes&#xf6;k under 2014. Syftet &#xe4;r att utbyta erfarenheter mellan budgetsektionerna hos de b&#xe5;da departementen. Samarbetsparterna ska unders&#xf6;ka om svenska erfarenheter avseende budgetreformering kan till&#xe4;mpas i Tanzania samt utforska m&#xf6;jligheter till ett f&#xf6;rdjupat samarbete.</narrative>
  </description>
